    "# What does NULL mean?\n",
    "I hope you were paying attention in the video. Pop quiz: What does NULL represent?\n",
    "\n",
    "## Possible Answers\n",
    "1. A corrupt entry\n",
    "2. A missing value\n",
    "3. An empty string\n",
    "4. An invalid value\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "## Correct Answer\n",
    "2. A missing value\n"
